  "foaf:name": "Advancing Indigenous Partnerships in Ocean Science for Sustainability: A contribution to the United Nations Decade of Ocean Science for Sustainable Development",
  "sdo:name": "Advancing Indigenous Partnerships in Ocean Science for Sustainability: A contribution to the United Nations Decade of Ocean Science for Sustainable Development",
